                                                "sense_id": "29a8b40d-dac9-34b4-aae1-2496072d4945",
                                                "text": "A new concept car from Honda — a hydrogen-powered vehicle — sat inside the walls of a just-completed plexiglass tent at the corner of Seventh and Main Streets in the heart of downtown Park City, promoting the green pleasures of its energy conservation."
                                            }
